twice as smoothly in a well-filled swamp.No more small freezes at sunrise and sunset.A new matte look: decorations, plants and clothes no longer shine like plastic. Glass keeps its reflections.When the camera goes into a big tree, the leaves fade away instead of hiding everything.Decorate up highShift + Enlarge now \\lifts\\ a decoration","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:49:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029564","verified_at":"2026-10-21T20:08:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5007660-1846651706676952","game_id":"steam-5007660","kind":"announcement","title":"Beta 0.7: a swamp you can hear","summary":"Hi everyone!A new update for the Froggous Grove demo. Your saves are kept: you pick up your swamp right where you left it.A brand new soundscapeThe swamp now has its own living soundscape: wind, rain, a stream, drips in the cave, rustling grass...The healthier your swamp, the more birds come back to sing. A polluted swamp stays silent.Animals sound different depending on the ground: grass, mud, rock, wood, leaves or water.Water sounds have been rebalanced so they no longer drown out everything e","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T09:33:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676952","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5007660-1846018067930902","game_id":"steam-5007660","kind":"announcement","title":"Beta 0.6: a swamp that lives day and night","summary":"Hello everyone!A big day of work on the Froggous Grove demo: here is everything that changes. Your saves are kept, you pick up your swamp right where you left it.Animals sleepAt night, frogs look for a free lily pad to sleep on. No lily pad big enough, or already taken? They sleep on the ground... and they let you know.Frogs close their eyes while sleeping, and \" ZzZz \" float above every sleeping animal. Lily pads can be enlarged (up to 2.5 times) to fit the biggest frogs.Needs for every animalE","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T17:47:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930902","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5007660-1846018067927140","game_id":"steam-5007660","kind":"announcement","title":"The Froggous Grove demo has moved to Beta 0.5","summary":"Thank you to everyone who played the first demo and sent me feedback! ːsteamhappyːImportant: the game has changed a lot, so saves from the previous demo are no longer compatible. On first launch they are set aside (not deleted) and you start again from the tutorial. What's new A fully rebuilt swamp and a brand new interface.Chamblins: new creatures to tame. Give them a light and play with them… the demo ends when three Chamblins have adopted you! Froggous now has a mood that follows the health o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T18:46:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927140","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5007660-1845383656385520","game_id":"steam-5007660","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log, October 1, 2026","summary":"Dev Log October 1, 2026- Hello, everyone!First of all, I’d like to thank everyone who’s interested in the game and has added it to their wishlist! It really helps me stay motivated and boosts the game’s visibility among other potential players who’d like to join us on this adventure.Froggous Grove isn’t just a game to me—it’s my very first one, and it’s also meant to revive a style that’s been lost for quite a few years.I’m developing this on my own, so it’s definitely taking me longer than it w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T09:02:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385520","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5007660-1843481262694422","game_id":"steam-5007660","kind":"announcement","title":"The Froggous Grove Demo Is Available!","summary":"The Froggous Grove Demo Is Available!Hello everyone,I'm thrilled to announce that the Froggous Grove demo is available right now!Froggous Grove is a cozy voxel life-sim where you raise frogs, design your own swamp, and take care of your little corner of nature. This demo lets you experience:The full frog-raising loop, from egg to adulthoodGathering resources and maintaining your swampFroggous' shop and your first decorationsThe day/night cycle and the game's atmosphere I'm developing this game s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T08:24:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262694422","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5007660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:51Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5007660":"2026-10-26T07:13:51Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5007660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:51Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:51Z"},"5227210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:51Z","status":"ok","error_c